Data sources
------------

The API serves data derived from the following sources. Each keeps its own terms; this licence
covers the code only.

Air-quality sensor data: pulse.eco (https://pulse.eco).
  Crowdsourced data, provided by pulse.eco without a guarantee of correctness.
  "(c) pulse.eco. All rights reserved." No open reuse licence has been confirmed; the operator
  is to confirm the terms of reuse with pulse.eco.

Weather and air-pollution data: OpenWeather (https://openweathermap.org).
  Licensed under the Open Database License (ODbL). Attribution: "Weather data (c) OpenWeather".
  OpenWeather requires the attribution to be visible in the application, not only in legal pages.

Map data (rendered by aqra-frontend): OpenStreetMap contributors
  (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright), Open Database License (ODbL).
